+ *     fields, plus the {@code @timestamp} / {@code dim} fields that TSDB requires. Both sides of an IN comparison whose type is
+ *     {@code COUNTER_*} route here through {@link TestConfig#mainIndex} / {@link TestConfig#subIndex}.</li>
+ * </ul>
